 "structural_change": "SQ-C2-N59 (10-21) MAIN: successor of qfd_n59_svc4 for the master the Q die actually binds (qfd_native59_dv_headprep_obs1 b8f883e7 -> u_svc qfd_native59_svc_obs1, HEAD_PREP 1 NU 4 ROPE 1 USER_BIND 1 MCTX 1 EMB_RELAY 1; + RECV_INPUTS 1 LOCAL32 1 as svc3/svc4).  svc4 = qfd_native59_svc, ONE clock root 21,950 sinks, pin-flop spread TT 84.6 ps (> 80) closed only under a coordinator waiver; owner 10-21: no waiver, no shrink.  Fix: physical/common_flow/clock_regions_2lvl.tcl mode we: 2 regional roots W/E (seam x 259.2, under the N-face ck pin) x 6 k-means leaf roots per region; no leaf cluster or CTS subtree crosses a seam; seam crossings are flop -> flop between regional trees of one synchronous clock (fixed latency 1 edge).  Same outline 518.4 x 216, PDN, layer contract, reach relocation hooks and cycles as svc4.  Face pins/um {'N': 3.54, 'E': 4.78, 'W': 3.21, 'S': 2.08}."
